<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #f59e0b;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
        }
        .content {
            background-color: #f9fafb;
            padding: 30px;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-top: none;
        }
        .warning-box {
            background-color: #fffbeb;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
        }
        .manifest-info {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .action-button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background-color: #2563eb;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>Broker Deactivation Alert</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <p>Hello {{ consignee.businessName }},</p>
        
        <div class="warning-box">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">⚠️ Action Required</h3>
            <p>The broker assigned to your manifest has been deactivated and can no longer process this shipment.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="manifest-info">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Affected Manifest</h3>
            <p><strong>Manifest Number:</strong> {{ manifest.manifestNumber }}</p>
            {% if manifest.vesselName %}
            <p><strong>Vessel:</strong> {{ manifest.vesselName }}</p>
            {% endif %}
            <p><strong>Inactive Broker:</strong> {{ broker.fullName }}</p>
            <p><strong>Deactivated Since:</strong> {{ deactivatedAt|date('F j, Y') }}</p>
        </div>
        
        <p><strong>What You Need to Do:</strong></p>
        <ol>
            <li>Log in to your OPTIMUS account</li>
            <li>Navigate to the affected manifest</li>
            <li>Request a broker transfer to one of your active brokers</li>
            <li>Wait for shipping line staff approval</li>
        </ol>
        
        <center>
            <a href="{{ manifestUrl }}" class="action-button">View Manifest & Request Transfer</a>
        </center>
        
        <p>The manifest will remain in an inactive state until a new broker is assigned. Please take action as soon as possible to avoid delays in your shipment processing.</p>
        
        <p>If you need assistance or have questions, please contact support.</p>
        
        <p>Best regards,<br>The OPTIMUS Team</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>This is an automated message from OPTIMUS Shipping Portal.</p>
        <p>© {{ 'now'|date('Y') }} OPTIMUS. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
